e-modal-box\"></aside>\r\n<aside id=\"provisionModal\" class=\"modal size-small provision-policy-modal table-modal-box\"></aside>\r\n<aside id=\"noEmailModal\" class=\"modal size-small provision-policy-modal table-modal-box\"></aside>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>", "source": "https://scienceon.kisti.re.kr/srch/selectPORSrchArticle.do?cn=NPAP08155200"}, {"title": "[논문]헬리콥터 오토로테이션시 착륙장치 거동에 관한 연구", "url": "https://scienceon.kisti.re.kr/srch/selectPORSrchArticle.do?cn=JAKO201213660554224&dbt=NART", "content": "... 연구\" 韓國軍事科學技術學會誌 = Journal of the KIMST v.15 no.6 (6) pp. 738~745. 원문보기 상세보기. 활용도 분석정보. 상세보기: 272. 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 ...", "raw_content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"KO\">\r\n<head>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\t<!--  Title 상단으로 변경 -->\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<title>[논문]헬리콥터 오토로테이션시 착륙장치 거동에 관한 연구</title>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"title\" content=\"[논문]헬리콥터 오토로테이션시 착륙장치 거동에 관한 연구\" />\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"author\" content=\"최형태, 오정진, 김근원, 신기수\" />\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"publisher\" content=\"한국군사과학기술학회\"/>\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"Keywords\" content=\"유한요소법, 오토로테이션, 하드랜딩, 스키드기어\"/>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://scienceon.kisti.re.kr/srch/selectPORSrchArticle.do?cn=JAKO201213660554224\">\r\n\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_journal_title\" content=\"韓國軍事科學技術學會誌 = Journal of the KIMST\" />\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_volume\" content=\"15\" />\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_issue\" content=\"6\" />\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_publication_date\" content=\"2012\" />\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_firstpage\" content=\"746\" />\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_lastpage\" content=\"753\" />\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_publisher\" content=\"한국군사과학기술학회\" />\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_doi\" content=\"10.9766/kimst.2012.15.6.746\" />\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_author\" content=\"최형태\" />\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_author\" content=\"오정진\" />\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_author\" content=\"김근원\" />\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_author\" content=\"신기수\" />\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_title\" content=\"[논문]헬리콥터 오토로테이션시 착륙장치 거동에 관한 연구\" />\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_issn\" content=\"1598-9127\" />\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_abstract_html_url\" content=\"http://scienceon.kisti.re.kr/srch/selectPORSrchArticle.do?cn=JAKO201213660554224\" />\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_keywords\" content=\"유한요소법 . 오토로테이션 . 하드랜딩 . 스키드기어\" />\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_abstract\" content=\"ROK military helicopters are frequently exposed to the hazard situations due to the characteristic of operation. Especially, helicopter accident may lead to critical damage of human and structure. Accordingly, pilots have to train the autorotation procedures and learn the skill to prevent hard landing. In this paper, the behavior of skid gear subject to the helicopter autorotation was conducted by using numerical method. The computer simulation approach by using finite element method was employed to accomplish this goal. Additionally, the behavior of skid gear was evaluated for the different landing conditions. In conclusion, the maximum stress concentration was occurred at the attached area of skid cross-tube to the fuselage. Also, it was revealed that the most proper attitude was level landing to prevent hard landing.\" />\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<meta name=\"citation_pdf_url\" content=\"http://scienceon.kisti.re.kr/commons/util/originalView.do?cn=JAKO201213660554224&dbt=JAKO&oCn=JAKO201213660554224&journal=NJOU00294285\" />\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\t<!-- MetaTag 순서 변경 : title, author, publisher, keywords, description -->\r\n\r\n\t<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"[논문]헬리콥터 오토로테이션시 착륙장치 거동에 관한 연구\"/>\r\n\t<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"ScienceON\"/>\r\n\t<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/>\r\n\t<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"ROK military helicopters are frequently exposed to the hazard situations due to the characteristic of operation. Especially, helicopter accident may lead to critical damage of human and structure. Accordingly, pilots have to train the autorotation procedures and learn the skill to prevent hard landing. In this paper, the behavior of skid gear subject to the helicopter autorotation was conducted by using numerical method. The computer simulation approach by using finite element method was employed to accomplish this goal. Additionally, the behavior of skid gear was evaluated for the different landing conditions. In conclusion, the maximum stress concentration was occurred at the attached area of skid cross-tube to the fuselage. Also, it was revealed that the most proper attitude was level landing to prevent hard landing.\"/>\r\n\t<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://scienceon.kisti.re.kr/images/usr/scienceon_og.png\"/>\r\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"270\" />\r\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"270\" />\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\t<!-- img -->\r\n\t<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"57x57\" href=\"/newUI/img/favicon/apple-touch-icon-57x57.png\" />\r\n\t<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"114x114\" href=\"/newUI/img/favicon/apple-touch-icon-114x114.png\" />\r\n\t<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"72x72\" href=\"/newUI/img/favicon/apple-touch-icon-72x72.png\" />\r\n\t<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"144x144\" href=\"/newUI/img/favicon/apple-touch-icon-144x144.png\" />\r\n\t<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"60x60\" href=\"/newUI/img/favicon/apple-touch-icon-60x60.png\" />\r\n\t<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"120x120\" href=\"/newUI/img/favicon/apple-touch-icon-120x120.png\" />\r\n\t<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"76x76\" href=\"/newUI/img/favicon/apple-touch-icon-76x76.png\" />\r\n\t<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-preco